{
	title: 'Discoverable help for all Tsk features',
	spec: 'Top-level help (tsk, tsk help, tsk --help, tsk -h) advertises all commands and features, including notes, and points to tsk --detailed-help. That option explains the full task and project structure, every supported field, artifacts, and the rebuild workflow with concise examples. tsk <command> --help gives command-specific usage, options, and examples. Help does not run commands or require a Tsk project.',
